      <div class="row"><img class="row__lead" src="../../kit/assets/photo/product-peony-pink.webp" alt=""><div class="row__main"><p class="row__title one-line">粉芍药花束</p><div class="rw-tg__t"><span class="tag" data-tone="action">新品</span><span class="tag" data-tone="info">2 小时达</span></div></div><span class="price"><small>¥</small>239</span></div>
