        <div class="row"><img class="row__lead" src="../../kit/assets/photo/product-peony-pink.webp" alt=""><div class="row__main"><p class="row__title one-line">粉芍药花束</p><p class="row__meta">11 枝</p></div><span class="price"><small>¥</small>239</span></div>
      </div></div>
